{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/919813877/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1749224428000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.anthropic.com/claude-explains\" target=\"_blank\">Claude, with human oversight, is writing its own blog</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://larrysummers.com/news-item/stan-fischer/\" target=\"_blank\">Larry Summers on Stanley Fischer</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.tiktok.com/@zauey/video/7512309763850505514?_r=1&amp;_t=ZP-8wwlBDYW1p0\" target=\"_blank\">My SEJ piece with Alex T., on avant-garde culture, makes it to TikTok</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/03/arts/music/per-norgard-dead.html\" target=\"_blank\">Per Norgard</a>, RIP (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.politico.eu/article/nuclear-power-will-spending-reviews-big-winner-philip-hunt/\" target=\"_blank\">Is Britain going all-in on nuclear power?</a></p>\r\n<p>6. “An auto driver in Mumbai is earning Rs 5-8 lakh a month without driving by offering a bag-keeping service outside the US Consulate, where bags are prohibited. He earns ₹1,000 per bag and serves 20–30 customers daily.”  Link <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/indiantechguide/status/1930580367112618125?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/yurimilner/status/1930710873145737508\" target=\"_blank\">Claims about neurons and light</a>.  Speculative and unconfirmed, but if true does not ease the path for ASI.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://finance.yahoo.com/news/geo